1099 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Outerwear \046 materials\nDeveloped down\054 double\055faced wool\054 leather\054 fur and tweed outerwear\056\nProduct development\nDesign proposals\054 technical packs\054 sample fittings\054 revisions\054 production and QC\056\nTrend \046 styling research\nTranslated WGSN\054 runway and styling research into brand\055relevant shapes and details\056\nAI visualization\nVisualized alternatives\054 proportions\054 textures and details to communicate design intent\056\nCollaborations\n2022 SS Jang Woo\055chul\072 sole jersey designer\073 co\055planned the tennis capsule with a senior designer\056\n2023 SS Yoo Ji\055hye\072 participated in a brand\055wide collaboration\056\n2025 SS VB\053YK with Jung Yoon\055ki\072 developed logo tees\054 caps\054 bear keyrings\054 labels\054 embroidery\054 graphics and packaging\056)
     /K [ 29 ]
     /P 1100 0 R
     /Pg 1041 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
