1101 0 obj
  << /ActualText (New concepts into lasting products\nProposed jersey tops with a woven\055top look\054 replacing lace and prints with refined silhouettes and finishes\056 Developed the concept into a recurring product line\056\nDesigning for a broader customer base\nExtended the top into online colors\054 sleeved and casual versions\054 retaining its character while accommodating different preferences for coverage and fit\056\nSeries development from sales feedback\nExpanded a well\055received round\055neck tee into turtleneck and wool\055stripe styles\054 adapting fabrics and styling across seasons\056)
     /K [ 30 ]
